docs/src/user/en\basics\interface.md:5:The same navigation keys also drive WowVision's own screens: the [WowVision menu and settings](./menu-and-settings.md), the [keybinding screen](./keybindings.md), context menus and the game's dropdown menus.
docs/src/user/en\basics\interface.md:20:All of these can be changed in the [keybinding screen](./keybindings.md). Most are "vital": they can be moved to another key, but never removed completely.
