docs/src/user/en\basics\menu-and-settings.md:109:The Sound setting of an alert's sound output, and the Beacon Sound setting of a beacon, open a browser of audio files.
docs/src/user/en\basics\menu-and-settings.md:116:Escape goes back one folder without choosing anything. The top of the browser also shows Voice and Beacon folders, which hold files for other kinds of output.
